{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/TopAbout.png?t=1751167293\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Necro Siege</strong> is a down and dirty <strong>First-Person Action Horror Shooter</strong> crafted by <strong>one developer</strong> with a love of everything horror and <strong>community-driven development.</strong> In this early stage of development players have the opportunity to <strong>help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>Necro Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world where humanity is on the brink of extinction as otherworldly abominations rise from the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/SmackitySmack.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Download the demo now</strong> and experience visceral gunplay and physics-based dismemberment. Then get involved and help make this the game you want it to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Dark Dystopian Nightmare with no room for humanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/bug3.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Necro Siege</strong>\u00a0journey through forsaken realms confronting eldritch nightmares, zombies, demons, and other horrors in a desperate fight against the end of all things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/bod2.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f CORE FEATURES \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf Endless Horde Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face increasingly powerful waves of demonic enemies. The longer you last, the tougher they get. How long can you hold them off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/BigGuy.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Secrets</strong><br>Explore the ruins of civilization, solve dark puzzles, and uncover hidden areas as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Help Shape the Game</strong><br>As an Early Access title developed by a solo dev, your feedback is crucial. Weapon balance, enemy behavior, puzzle design\u2014you can influence it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Solo Dev Passion Project</strong><br>Crafted by one developer with a love for intense survival games and community-driven development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2803570?t=1751167293","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/e0cb13f3c479ec7f5c6bbdd29e4da0470795650b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751167293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/41b500eace715b0d2002b5ebae475dd8ff0b4760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751167293","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/41b500eace715b0d2002b5ebae475dd8ff0b4760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751167293","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may include content that is unsuitable for all ages or may not be suitable for viewing in a work environment, such as frequent violence, gore, and general mature themes."},"demos":[{"appid":3163140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/TopAbout.png?t=1751167293\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Necro Siege</strong> is a down and dirty <strong>First-Person Action Horror Shooter</strong> crafted by <strong>one developer</strong> with a love of everything horror and <strong>community-driven development.</strong> In this early stage of development players have the opportunity to <strong>help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>Necro Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world where humanity is on the brink of extinction as otherworldly abominations rise from the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/SmackitySmack.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Download the demo now</strong> and experience visceral gunplay and physics-based dismemberment. Then get involved and help make this the game you want it to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Dark Dystopian Nightmare with no room for humanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/bug3.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Necro Siege</strong>\u00a0journey through forsaken realms confronting eldritch nightmares, zombies, demons, and other horrors in a desperate fight against the end of all things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/bod2.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f CORE FEATURES \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf Endless Horde Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face increasingly powerful waves of demonic enemies. The longer you last, the tougher they get. How long can you hold them off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/BigGuy.gif?t=1751167293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Secrets</strong><br>Explore the ruins of civilization, solve dark puzzles, and uncover hidden areas as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Help Shape the Game</strong><br>As an Early Access title developed by a solo dev, your feedback is crucial. Weapon balance, enemy behavior, puzzle design\u2014you can influence it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Solo Dev Passion Project</strong><br>Crafted by one developer with a love for intense survival games and community-driven development.</p>","developers":["Krypsis Syndicate LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/1d4b85505891f2680e318e077365739380a2b4f3/header.jpg?t=1751167293","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147472,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstat